{"seq":1,"slug":"macros-templates","title":"Nim 宏与模板系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/macros-templates","wordCount":830,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-宏与模板系统\">Nim 宏与模板系统</h1><p>Nim 的元编程分为三个层级：模板（template）做卫生的代码替换、宏（macro）做完整的 AST 变换、泛型（generics）做参数化多态。前两者在编译期操作抽象语法树，使用与普通 Nim 代码相同的语法——不需要学习独立的元语言。本文聚焦模板与宏的核心机制及其协作模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>模板</strong>：卫生的 AST 替换机制，编译时展开，零运行时开销，适合简单代码生成</li>\n<li><strong>宏</strong>：接收 NimNode（AST）参数并返回新 AST 的编译期函数，适合复杂代码变换</li>\n<li><strong>元类型参数</strong>：untyped（延迟检查）、typed（已检查）、typedesc（接受类型）控制参数何时做语义分析</li>\n<li><strong>quote do</strong>：AST 构建的语法糖，反引号插入变量，避免手动构建节点树</li>\n<li><strong>卫生性</strong>：模板内部符号默认 gensym（不泄漏），可通过 inject 主动注入到调用者作用域</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"模板-卫生的代码替换\">模板：卫生的代码替换</h2><p>模板是一种在调用点展开的代码生成机制。与 C 宏的文本替换不同，Nim 模板操作的是 AST 节点，并且默认是<strong>卫生的</strong>（hygienic）——模板内部声明的符号不会泄漏到调用者的作用域：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"template withLock(lock: Lock, body: untyped): untyped =&#10;  acquire(lock)&#10;  try:&#10;    body&#10;  finally:&#10;    release(lock)&#10;&#10;var mtx: Lock&#10;initLock(mtx)&#10;&#10;withLock(mtx):&#10;  # body 在这里展开，lock 的作用域不会污染外部&#10;  sharedData.add(&quot;item&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>template withLock(lock: Lock, body: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  acquire(lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  finally:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    release(lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var mtx: Lock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>initLock(mtx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>withLock(mtx):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # body 在这里展开，lock 的作用域不会污染外部</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sharedData.add(\"item\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"元类型参数\">元类型参数</h3><p>模板参数的元类型决定了何时进行类型检查：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元类型</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>untyped</code></td>\n<td>延迟语义检查——传入时不做类型/符号解析</td>\n<td>接受代码块、构建 DSL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>typed</code></td>\n<td>传入时已完成类型检查</td>\n<td>需要类型信息的变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>typedesc</code></td>\n<td>接受类型本身作为参数</td>\n<td>类型级别的泛化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# untyped 参数允许传入尚未定义的标识符&#10;template declareVar(name: untyped, value: int): untyped =&#10;  var name = value&#10;&#10;declareVar(myCounter, 42)&#10;echo myCounter  # 42 —— myCounter 在模板展开时才被「创建」&#10;&#10;# typed 参数要求传入时表达式已合法&#10;template showType(x: typed): untyped =&#10;  echo &quot;Type of expression: &quot;, typeof(x)&#10;&#10;showType(3 + 4)  # &quot;Type of expression: int&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># untyped 参数允许传入尚未定义的标识符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template declareVar(name: untyped, value: int): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var name = value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>declareVar(myCounter, 42)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo myCounter  # 42 —— myCounter 在模板展开时才被「创建」</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># typed 参数要求传入时表达式已合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template showType(x: typed): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Type of expression: \", typeof(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>showType(3 + 4)  # \"Type of expression: int\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"符号注入与卫生控制\">符号注入与卫生控制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"template defineProperty(name: untyped, T: typedesc): untyped =&#10;  var `name Value`: T  # gensym（默认卫生）——不注入&#10;&#10;  proc `get name`(): T {.inject.} =  # inject —— 主动注入到调用者作用域&#10;    `name Value`&#10;&#10;  proc `set name`(val: T) {.inject.} =&#10;    `name Value` = val&#10;&#10;defineProperty(age, int)&#10;setAge(30)&#10;echo getAge()  # 30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>template defineProperty(name: untyped, T: typedesc): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var `name Value`: T  # gensym（默认卫生）——不注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc `get name`(): T {.inject.} =  # inject —— 主动注入到调用者作用域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    `name Value`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc `set name`(val: T) {.inject.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    `name Value` = val</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProperty(age, int)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setAge(30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo getAge()  # 30</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><code>{.inject.}</code> —— 将符号注入调用者作用域（模板的 proc/template/macro 参数默认注入）</li>\n<li><code>{.gensym.}</code> —— 生成唯一符号，防止名称冲突（var/let/const 默认 gensym）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"宏-ast-变换引擎\">宏：AST 变换引擎</h2><p>宏在编译的语义分析阶段执行，接收 AST 节点作为输入，返回新的 AST 节点作为输出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/macros&#10;&#10;macro debug(args: varargs[typed]): untyped =&#10;  ## 自动打印表达式文本及其值&#10;  result = newStmtList()&#10;  for arg in args:&#10;    let text = newStrLitNode(arg.repr)&#10;    result.add quote do:&#10;      echo `text`, &quot; = &quot;, `arg`&#10;&#10;let x = 42&#10;let y = &quot;hello&quot;&#10;debug(x, y, x + 10)&#10;# 输出:&#10;# x = 42&#10;# y = hello&#10;# x + 10 = 52\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro debug(args: varargs[typed]): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 自动打印表达式文本及其值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for arg in args:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let text = newStrLitNode(arg.repr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      echo `text`, \" = \", `arg`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let x = 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let y = \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>debug(x, y, x + 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 输出:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># x = 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># y = hello</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># x + 10 = 52</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"nimnode-api-与-ast-结构\">NimNode API 与 AST 结构</h3><p>Nim 的 AST 由 <code>NimNode</code> 类型表示。每个节点有一个 <code>kind</code>（如 <code>nnkStmtList</code>、<code>nnkCall</code>、<code>nnkIdent</code>）和子节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/macros&#10;&#10;macro generateGetters(typeDef: untyped): untyped =&#10;  ## 为 object 的每个字段自动生成 getter 过程&#10;  result = newStmtList()&#10;  result.add(typeDef)&#10;&#10;  let typeName = typeDef[0][0]&#10;  let recList = typeDef[0][2][0][2]  # object 字段列表&#10;&#10;  for field in recList:&#10;    let fieldName = field[0]&#10;    let fieldType = field[1]&#10;    let procName = ident(&quot;get&quot; &amp; $fieldName)&#10;    result.add quote do:&#10;      proc `procName`(obj: `typeName`): `fieldType` =&#10;        obj.`fieldName`&#10;&#10;generateGetters:&#10;  type Person = object&#10;    name: string&#10;    age: int&#10;&#10;let p = Person(name: &quot;Alice&quot;, age: 30)&#10;echo p.getName()  # Alice&#10;echo p.getAge()   # 30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro generateGetters(typeDef: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 为 object 的每个字段自动生成 getter 过程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result.add(typeDef)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let typeName = typeDef[0][0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let recList = typeDef[0][2][0][2]  # object 字段列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for field in recList:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fieldName = field[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fieldType = field[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let procName = ident(\"get\" &#x26; $fieldName)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      proc `procName`(obj: `typeName`): `fieldType` =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        obj.`fieldName`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>generateGetters:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type Person = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let p = Person(name: \"Alice\", age: 30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo p.getName()  # Alice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo p.getAge()   # 30</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[源代码] --&gt; B[解析为 AST]&#10;    B --&gt; C{遇到宏调用?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[将参数 AST 传给宏函数]&#10;    D --&gt; E[宏函数执行:操作 NimNode]&#10;    E --&gt; F[返回新 AST]&#10;    F --&gt; G[替换原调用点]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    C --&gt;|否| H[语义分析]&#10;    H --&gt; I[代码生成]\">graph TD\n    A[源代码] --&gt; B[解析为 AST]\n    B --&gt; C{遇到宏调用?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[将参数 AST 传给宏函数]\n    D --&gt; E[宏函数执行:操作 NimNode]\n    E --&gt; F[返回新 AST]\n    F --&gt; G[替换原调用点]\n    G --&gt; B\n    C --&gt;|否| H[语义分析]\n    H --&gt; I[代码生成]</pre><h3 id=\"quote-do-ast-模板化构建\">quote do：AST 模板化构建</h3><p><code>quote do</code> 是构建 AST 的语法糖——使用反引号 <code>`</code> 插入变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/macros&#10;&#10;macro createEnum(name: untyped, fields: varargs[untyped]): untyped =&#10;  var enumFields = newTree(nnkEnumTy, newEmptyNode())&#10;  for field in fields:&#10;    enumFields.add(field)&#10;&#10;  result = quote do:&#10;    type `name` = `enumFields`&#10;&#10;createEnum(Color, Red, Green, Blue)&#10;var c: Color = Red\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro createEnum(name: untyped, fields: varargs[untyped]): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var enumFields = newTree(nnkEnumTy, newEmptyNode())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for field in fields:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    enumFields.add(field)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type `name` = `enumFields`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createEnum(Color, Red, Green, Blue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var c: Color = Red</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"dumptree-与-dumpastgen-调试\">dumpTree 与 dumpAstGen 调试</h3><p>开发宏时最重要的工具是 <code>dumpTree</code>——它打印任意代码块的 AST 结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/macros&#10;&#10;dumpTree:&#10;  proc hello(name: string) =&#10;    echo &quot;Hello, &quot;, name&#10;&#10;# 编译期输出：&#10;# StmtList&#10;#   ProcDef&#10;#     Ident &quot;hello&quot;&#10;#     Empty&#10;#     Empty&#10;#     FormalParams&#10;#       Empty&#10;#       IdentDefs&#10;#         Ident &quot;name&quot;&#10;#         Ident &quot;string&quot;&#10;#         Empty&#10;#     Empty&#10;#     Empty&#10;#     StmtList&#10;#       Command&#10;#         Ident &quot;echo&quot;&#10;#         StrLit &quot;Hello, &quot;&#10;#         Ident &quot;name&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dumpTree:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  proc hello(name: string) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    echo \"Hello, \", name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 编译期输出：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># StmtList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   ProcDef</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     Ident \"hello\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     FormalParams</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#       Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#       IdentDefs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         Ident \"name\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         Ident \"string\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     Empty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#     StmtList</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#       Command</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         Ident \"echo\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         StrLit \"Hello, \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#         Ident \"name\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"模板与宏的协作模式\">模板与宏的协作模式</h2><p>实际项目中，模板和宏常常配合使用——模板处理简单替换，宏处理需要 AST 分析的复杂场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/macros&#10;&#10;# 模板提供 DSL 的语法糖层&#10;template route(path: string, body: untyped): untyped =&#10;  registerRoute(path, proc() = body)&#10;&#10;# 宏在编译期收集所有路由并生成路由表&#10;macro buildRouter(body: untyped): untyped =&#10;  result = newStmtList()&#10;  var routes = newTree(nnkBracket)&#10;&#10;  for stmt in body:&#10;    if stmt.kind == nnkCall and stmt[0].strVal == &quot;registerRoute&quot;:&#10;      let path = stmt[1]&#10;      routes.add(path)&#10;    result.add(stmt)&#10;&#10;  result.add quote do:&#10;    const allRoutes = `routes`\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 模板提供 DSL 的语法糖层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template route(path: string, body: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  registerRoute(path, proc() = body)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 宏在编译期收集所有路由并生成路由表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro buildRouter(body: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var routes = newTree(nnkBracket)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for stmt in body:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if stmt.kind == nnkCall and stmt[0].strVal == \"registerRoute\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let path = stmt[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      routes.add(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add(stmt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const allRoutes = `routes`</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战-自动序列化宏\">实战：自动序列化宏</h2><p>一个完整的宏示例——为任意 object 类型生成 JSON 序列化代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"import std/[macros, json]&#10;&#10;macro serializable(typeDef: untyped): untyped =&#10;  result = newStmtList()&#10;  result.add(typeDef)&#10;&#10;  let typeName = typeDef[0][0]&#10;  let fields = typeDef[0][2][0][2]&#10;&#10;  # 生成 toJson 过程&#10;  var jsonBody = newStmtList()&#10;  jsonBody.add quote do:&#10;    result = newJObject()&#10;&#10;  for field in fields:&#10;    let fname = field[0]&#10;    let fnameStr = newStrLitNode($fname)&#10;    jsonBody.add quote do:&#10;      result[`fnameStr`] = %(`typeName`(`fname`: obj.`fname`).`fname`)&#10;&#10;  result.add quote do:&#10;    proc toJson(obj: `typeName`): JsonNode =&#10;      `jsonBody`&#10;&#10;serializable:&#10;  type Config = object&#10;    host: string&#10;    port: int&#10;    debug: bool\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import std/[macros, json]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro serializable(typeDef: untyped): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result.add(typeDef)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let typeName = typeDef[0][0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let fields = typeDef[0][2][0][2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 生成 toJson 过程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var jsonBody = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  jsonBody.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = newJObject()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for field in fields:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fname = field[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fnameStr = newStrLitNode($fname)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    jsonBody.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      result[`fnameStr`] = %(`typeName`(`fname`: obj.`fname`).`fname`)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result.add quote do:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    proc toJson(obj: `typeName`): JsonNode =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      `jsonBody`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serializable:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  type Config = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    host: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    port: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    debug: bool</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nim 的宏与模板系统是其区别于其他系统语言的核心竞争力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模板提供零成本的代码替换，卫生性机制确保内部符号不会意外污染调用方</li>\n<li>宏通过 NimNode API 实现任意 AST 变换，能力等同于编写编译器插件</li>\n<li>dumpTree 是宏开发的第一工具——先看目标代码的 AST 结构，再编程生成它</li>\n<li>模板与宏常协作使用：模板提供面向用户的语法糖，宏在背后做重活</li>\n<li>与 Rust proc_macro 需要独立 crate 不同，Nim 宏直接在同一文件中定义和使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何在编译期直接执行 Nim 代码而不仅仅是变换 AST，参见 <a href=\"compile-time-execution\">编译期执行</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim 宏与模板系统","id":"nim-宏与模板系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"模板：卫生的代码替换","id":"模板-卫生的代码替换"},{"level":3,"text":"元类型参数","id":"元类型参数"},{"level":3,"text":"符号注入与卫生控制","id":"符号注入与卫生控制"},{"level":2,"text":"宏：AST 变换引擎","id":"宏-ast-变换引擎"},{"level":3,"text":"NimNode API 与 AST 结构","id":"nimnode-api-与-ast-结构"},{"level":3,"text":"quote do：AST 模板化构建","id":"quote-do-ast-模板化构建"},{"level":3,"text":"dumpTree 与 dumpAstGen 调试","id":"dumptree-与-dumpastgen-调试"},{"level":2,"text":"模板与宏的协作模式","id":"模板与宏的协作模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：自动序列化宏","id":"实战-自动序列化宏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nim 控制流与迭代器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/fundamentals/control-flow-iterators"},"next":{"title":"Nim 编译期执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/compile-time-execution"}}